\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs32\lang9 Food Court Billing System (Java Desktop Application)\par
\b0  Project Overview The Food Court Billing System is a Java desktop application developed to manage food orders, billing, customer details, and payments in a food court.\par
 The application provides a simple and user-friendly interface for the admin and cashier to perform daily billing operations efficiently. \par
It is developed using Java Swing, MySQL, and JDBC. \par
\par
\b Modules and Features\par
\b0  \b Module 1: Food Item Management\b0\par
 This module manages all food items available in the food court.\par
\b  Features\b0 :\par
\f1\bullet\f0  Add Food Item \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Update Food Item \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Delete Food Item \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Search Food Item \par
\f1\bullet\f0  View Menu List \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Category Management\par
\par
 \b Module 2: Billing System\par
\b0  This module generates customer bills quickly and accurately.\par
 \b Features\b0 : \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Select Food Items \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Enter Quantity \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Automatic Price Calculation \par
\f1\bullet\f0  GST Calculation\par
\f1\bullet\f0  Discount Option \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Generate and Print Bill\par
\par
 \b Module 3: Customer Management \par
\b0 This module stores customer information for billing and future reference.\par
 \b Features: \par
\b0\f1\bullet\f0  Add Customer \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Update Customer\par
\f1\bullet\f0  Search Customer \par
\f1\bullet\f0  View Customer Details\par
\f1\bullet\f0  Bill History \par
\par
\b Module 4: Payment Management\par
\b0  This module handles payment processing and confirmation.\par
\b  Features:\par
\b0  \f1\bullet\f0  Cash Payment\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  UPI Payment\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  Card Payment\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  Payment Confirmation\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  Payment Records\par
 \par
\b Module 5: Reports\b0\par
 This module provides sales reports and billing records.\par
 \b Features:\b0\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  Daily Sales Report\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  Monthly Sales Report\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  Total Revenue\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  Most Sold Items\par
 \f1\bullet\f0  Print Reports\par
\par
\b  Technologies Used\par
\b0\par
\f1\bullet\f0  Programming Language: Java\par
\f1\bullet\f0  GUI: Java Swing \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Database: MySQL \par
\f1\bullet\f0  Connectivity: JDBC \par
\f1\bullet\f0  IDE: NetBeans or Eclipse \par
\par
\b Final Database\par
\b0\par
1. Categories\par
2. Food_Items\par
3. Customers\par
4. Orders \par
5. Order_Details \par
6. Bills \par
7. Payment\par
\par
\par

